{"qid": "c04", "family": "c", "split": "dev", "method": "M3", "model": "luna", "answer": {"method": "M3", "model": "luna", "final": {"answer": "For FV-11-1, the Fisher ET datasheet lists a PTFE disk with fluorocarbon backup ring (-18 to 204°C), ethylene-propylene backup ring (-40 to 232°C), or nitrile backup ring (-40 to 71°C for air and hydrocarbons, or -40 to 82°C for other compatible fluids); its carbon-filled PTFE seal ring is rated -73 to 232°C. Spring-loaded plug seals include PTFE with an N10276 spring (-73 to 232°C), or PTFE/graphite with an R30003 spring (-73 to 316°C) with PEEK anti-extrusion rings. The PEEK option allows use up to 316°C in non-oxidizing service or 260°C in oxidizing service. Stainless-steel backup and retaining ring materials are also listed, but no limiting temperatures are stated for them.", "not_present": false}, "outcome": "ANSWERED", "route": ["context_rag+chunks"], "cypher": [], "sources": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "pages": [22, 21, 2, 12, 20, 5, 11, 4, 8]}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "pages": [7]}, {"document_id": "swagelok-ms-01-176", "pages": [15, 14]}], "latency_s": 8.970325700007379, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 200841, "completion_tokens": 964, "cost_usd": 0.025583255, "spent_usd": 0.025582925, "n_calls": 2, "n_cached": 1, "models": ["openai/gpt-6-luna", "qwen/qwen3-embedding-8b"]}, "trace": {"chunks": [{"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 22, "score": 0.7348}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 21, "score": 0.7306}, {"document_id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52", "page": 7, "score": 0.7229}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 2, "score": 0.7214}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 12, "score": 0.7094}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 20, "score": 0.7038}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 5, "score": 0.6971}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d100022x012", "page": 11, "score": 0.6869}, {"document_id": "fisher-et-d10